{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/3be9ba0952caee5aa2470eb4be464cd9.poster.avif?t=1756227866\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/3be9ba0952caee5aa2470eb4be464cd9.webm?t=1756227866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/3be9ba0952caee5aa2470eb4be464cd9.mp4?t=1756227866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It\u2019s John\u2019s House</strong> \u2013 A Game You Were Never Meant to Win</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You shouldn\u2019t be here. But now that you are, <strong>he</strong> won\u2019t let you leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. John Ravenwood\u2014a ghoul with a sinister sense of humour\u2014has invited you to play his little game. Your only chance of survival is to <strong>spot</strong>\u00a0<strong>the anomalies</strong> haunting each room. Something has moved. Something has changed. Something is watching. Find it before it finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because if you fail, <strong>Mama</strong> will come. And she doesn\u2019t let anyone escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/c3c1048ffb65c410a3ae161c8380b0dd.poster.avif?t=1756227866\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/c3c1048ffb65c410a3ae161c8380b0dd.webm?t=1756227866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/c3c1048ffb65c410a3ae161c8380b0dd.mp4?t=1756227866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Rules Are Simple:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Find the Anomalies</strong> \u2013 Every room holds a paranormal disturbance. Identify it correctly to move on.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Choose Wisely</strong> \u2013 Mark the wrong anomaly, and John will be very disappointed. Disappointment leads to punishment.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Hide or Run</strong> \u2013 If you anger the house, <strong>Mama</strong> will come for you. You can try to run, you can try to hide\u2014but you can\u2019t escape her.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Endless Loops</strong> \u2013 The house won\u2019t let you leave. You\u2019re stuck in a repeating cycle, forced to play John\u2019s game until you get it right\u2026 or die trying.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A Voice You Can\u2019t Ignore</strong> \u2013 Dr. John Ravenwood is always watching, always talking. His voice follows you through the radios, taunting, guiding\u2026 toying with you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Ever-Changing Nightmare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is different. The anomalies shift. The rules may twist. <strong>The house wants to break you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no escape\u2014only survival. <strong>Can you outplay John and make it out alive?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552200?t=1756227866","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/5dc0922a3f59dd64776616a350b1be7685b0500f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756227866","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/4b84dea7bf34e17833383c834d3bf06837632057/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756227866","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/4b84dea7bf34e17833383c834d3bf06837632057/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756227866","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"It's John's House features psychological horror with blood and gore (e.g., blood pools and stains on walls). The game includes disturbing themes, supernatural elements, and moments of violence, but no sexual content or nudity. It is intended for players who are comfortable with unsettling imagery and dark, intense horror."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/3be9ba0952caee5aa2470eb4be464cd9.poster.avif?t=1756227866\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/3be9ba0952caee5aa2470eb4be464cd9.webm?t=1756227866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/3be9ba0952caee5aa2470eb4be464cd9.mp4?t=1756227866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It\u2019s John\u2019s House</strong> \u2013 A Game You Were Never Meant to Win</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You shouldn\u2019t be here. But now that you are, <strong>he</strong> won\u2019t let you leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. John Ravenwood\u2014a ghoul with a sinister sense of humour\u2014has invited you to play his little game. Your only chance of survival is to <strong>spot</strong>\u00a0<strong>the anomalies</strong> haunting each room. Something has moved. Something has changed. Something is watching. Find it before it finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because if you fail, <strong>Mama</strong> will come. And she doesn\u2019t let anyone escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/c3c1048ffb65c410a3ae161c8380b0dd.poster.avif?t=1756227866\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/c3c1048ffb65c410a3ae161c8380b0dd.webm?t=1756227866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/extras/c3c1048ffb65c410a3ae161c8380b0dd.mp4?t=1756227866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Rules Are Simple:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Find the Anomalies</strong> \u2013 Every room holds a paranormal disturbance. Identify it correctly to move on.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Choose Wisely</strong> \u2013 Mark the wrong anomaly, and John will be very disappointed. Disappointment leads to punishment.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Hide or Run</strong> \u2013 If you anger the house, <strong>Mama</strong> will come for you. You can try to run, you can try to hide\u2014but you can\u2019t escape her.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Endless Loops</strong> \u2013 The house won\u2019t let you leave. You\u2019re stuck in a repeating cycle, forced to play John\u2019s game until you get it right\u2026 or die trying.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A Voice You Can\u2019t Ignore</strong> \u2013 Dr. John Ravenwood is always watching, always talking. His voice follows you through the radios, taunting, guiding\u2026 toying with you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Ever-Changing Nightmare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is different. The anomalies shift. The rules may twist. <strong>The house wants to break you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no escape\u2014only survival. <strong>Can you outplay John and make it out alive?</strong></p>","developers":["Patrik Macsuga"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552200/4c9817fc11da55c8f339a70704397fb22d7b4cd8/header.jpg?t=1756227866","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Patrik Macsuga 2025. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257177550,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177550/movie480.mp4?t=1754227212","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177550/movie_max.mp4?t=1754227212"},"name":"It's John's House Intro","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257177550/25150375421f8f812365867f4ad7b4db590bccbe/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754227212","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177550/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754227212","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257177550/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754227212"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257158305,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158305/movie480.mp4?t=1750258746","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158305/movie_max.mp4?t=1750258746"},"name":"It's John's House Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257158305/6941f78491ab214053f867dd01b383248815fc9a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750258746","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158305/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750258746","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158305/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750258746"}}],"name":"It's John's House","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Proc